369
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:54,920
Yes.

370
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:55,640
She said it out loud.

371
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:56,360
Yes.

372
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,200
