All right.

441
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:01,840
It felt very genuine.

442
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,200
So genuine.

443
00:14:04,250 --> 00:14:05,160
If I compare the two of them,

444
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:06,480
