445
00:14:06,620 --> 00:14:07,560
Oh,

446
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:08,160
Cao Yiheng.

447
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:12,440
I'll wait and see if he sends
me a message today.

448
00:14:12,620 --> 00:14:13,770
