451
00:14:14,990 --> 00:14:15,640
I support you.

452
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:17,320
Support her every decision.

453
00:14:18,340 --> 00:14:19,740
(Congratulations on becoming
one of the Courageous)

454
00:14:19,890 --> 00:14:21,840
Congratulations on becoming
one of the Courageous.

455
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:24,220
