488
00:15:37,950 --> 00:15:38,740
Because...

489
00:15:38,740 --> 00:15:39,780
Because I wanted to see you.

490
00:15:40,130 --> 00:15:41,150
Because I wanted to see you.

491
00:15:41,150 --> 00:15:42,580
(Because I wanted to see you)

492
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:45,000
Because I wanted to see you.

493
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,600
We've got someone who's very direct.

494
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:50,490
Indeed. I didn't

