They brought flowers for each other.

507
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:20,280
That's lovely.

508
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:21,460
(Full of ceremony and thoughtfulness)

509
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:24,560
I think TOMO

510
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:26,040
