00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:20,520
Perfect timing.

856
00:26:20,740 --> 00:26:22,430
Why did the lights come on?

857
00:26:22,560 --> 00:26:23,280
I pressed it.

858
00:26:23,280 --> 00:26:23,700
Hahaha.

859
00:26:23,700 --> 00:26:24,650
Someone must

860
00:26:25,060 --> 00:26:25,840
have used it.

861
00:26:26,490 --> 00:26:27,330
It couldn't be you, right?

862
00:26:27,560 --> 00:26:28,430
Why couldn't it be me?

863
00:26:29,070 --> 00:26:30,640
(First stargazing room date invitation)
Would you like to watch the stars tonight?

864
00:26:30,640 --> 00:26:31,280
Okay.

865
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:33,280
Look at her cheekbones.

866
00:26:33,280 --> 00:26:34,120
She's pleasantly surprised.

867
00:26:34,450 --> 00:26:36,070
I'd also like to get to know you better.

868
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:39,320
Sure.

869
00:26:39,320 --> 00:26:39,920
Interesting.

870
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:41,120
Of course.

871
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:43,040
Yesterday, when we got

872
00:26:43,430 --> 00:26:45,060
into our cars in the parking garage,

873
00:26:45,060 --> 00:26:46,260
I actually wanted to invite you

874
00:26:46,260 --> 00:26:47,370
into my car.

875
00:26:47,370 --> 00:26:48,000
But the truth is,

876
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:49,700
I got a message during dinner.

877
00:26:49,700 --> 00:26:51,100
The new girl sent me a message

878
00:26:51,100 --> 00:26:51,420
saying...

879
00:26:52,270 --> 00:26:53,920
(She wanted to ride in the same car)
He explained it immediately.

880
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:54,760
Yes.

881
00:26:54,760 --> 00:26:55,760
He explained everything.

882
00:26:55,760 --> 00:26:56,960
That's good. Very good.

883
00:26:58,400 --> 00:27:00,520
I think him clearing up
the misunderstanding

884
00:27:00,520 --> 00:27:02,000
definitely earns him some extra points.

885
00:27:02,760 --> 00:27:03,840
He didn't

886
00:27:03,840 --> 00:27:04,600
delay until

887
00:27:04,600 --> 00:27:05,640
the next day

888
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:06,640
to tell her.

889
00:27:06,880 --> 00:27:07,520
He was aware

890
00:27:07,520 --> 00:27:09,280
that she was confused.

891
00:27:09,280 --> 00:27:09,920
Yes.

892
00:27:09,920 --> 00:27:11,120
So he explained it immediately.

893
00:27:11,120 --> 00:27:12,000
I think that's very good.

894
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:17,800
I saw that.

895
00:27:21,700 --> 00:27:23,140
Yes. I'm very straightforward.

896
00:27:23,440 --> 00:27:24,240
This angle.

897
00:27:24,300 --> 00:27:25,700
I don't particularly like being evasive.

898
00:27:29,460 --> 00:27:30,300
(Turning around)

899
00:27:33,120 --> 00:27:33,800
He ran into someone.

900
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:36,200
He's in such a hurry.
Is he going out?

901
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,040
Is he making a wish too?

902
00:27:42,160 --> 00:27:44,160
Is he joining them, or...

903
00:27:53,740 --> 00:27:54,300
Hello.

904
00:27:55,390 --> 00:27:56,050
Hello.

905
00:27:56,280 --> 00:27:57,480
What are you two talking about?

906
00:27:57,990 --> 00:27:58,980
Hello. You're back.

907
00:28:00,760 --> 00:28:02,080
That's an interesting way to end it.

908
00:28:03,880 --> 00:28:05,320
Zhao Xilun really surprised me.

909
00:28:06,280 --> 00:28:07,520
Although he studies mathematics,

910
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:11,480
he's quite decisive
when it comes to relationships.

911
00:28:11,480 --> 00:28:12,760
He's willing to take risks.

912
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:14,800
Yes. He's quite willing
to take the initiative.

913
00:28:14,800 --> 00:28:16,400
We've seen so many dates today.

914
00:28:16,600 --> 00:28:17,600
I want to keep watching.

915
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:18,640
Yes.

916
00:28:18,760 --> 00:28:20,840
Because this is only their first date.

917
00:28:20,840 --> 00:28:21,640
Right.

918
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:23,240
It's truly only the beginning.

919
00:28:23,240 --> 00:28:23,920
Yes.

920
00:28:23,920 --> 00:28:24,360
Everyone

921
00:28:24,360 --> 00:28:25,720
is still getting to know each other.

922
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:27,520
So we definitely have to keep watching.

923
00:28:28,520 --> 00:28:29,260
I'm looking forward to it.

924
00:28:29,260 --> 00:28:29,880
(Everyone is looking forward to it)
Exactly.

925
00:28:29,880 --> 00:28:30,780
(Everyone is looking forward to it)
Looking forward to it.

926
00:28:30,920 --> 00:28:32,080
Then why don't we

927
00:28:32,440 --> 00:28:34,720
take a photo together?

928
00:28:36,360 --> 00:28:37,560
One, two, three.

929
00:28:39,460 --> 00:28:40,220
Ah!

930
00:28:40,420 --> 00:28:41,140
Ah!

931
00:28:41,360 --> 00:28:43,880
Oscar isn't in the frame.

932
00:28:45,400 --> 00:28:46,520
Oscar, move down a little.

933
00:28:46,520 --> 00:28:47,280
I'm right here.

934
00:28:47,280 --> 00:28:48,240
His face is against mine.

935
00:28:49,120 --> 00:28:50,920
One, two, three.

936
00:28:52,040 --> 00:28:52,360
Okay.

937
00:28:52,360 --> 00:28:53,360
This should work.

938
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:53,920
I'm so curious.

939
00:28:54,240 --> 00:28:55,000
Oscar.

940
00:28:56,560 --> 00:28:57,640
Still not in it.

941
00:28:58,120 --> 00:28:58,840
Look at this.

942
00:28:59,840 --> 00:29:01,080
Only half of Oscar is in the frame.

943
00:29:01,080 --> 00:29:01,840
How about we

944
00:29:01,840 --> 00:29:03,080
have Cao Yiheng draw something?

945
00:29:04,120 --> 00:29:06,240
Add on eyes for Oscar.

946
00:29:06,520 --> 00:29:07,680
Alright, I'll do it.

947
00:29:07,680 --> 00:29:08,480
Come here.

948
00:29:11,420 --> 00:29:13,700
Hahaha.

949
00:29:13,800 --> 00:29:14,720
There we go.

950
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:15,360
One more.

951
00:29:15,360 --> 00:29:15,880
The final one.

952
00:29:16,280 --> 00:29:17,760
Watching Heart Signal with You,

953
00:29:17,760 --> 00:29:19,040
the sparks never end.

954
00:29:19,040 --> 00:29:20,600
See you next time!

955
00:29:20,880 --> 00:29:21,720
Bye.

